    "# Troubleshooting"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "68851bab",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Things go wrong sometimes: a run crashes, the batch system does not recognize your project,\n",
    "or a case just will not build. This chapter collects the most common problems, where to look\n",
    "for clues, and where to ask for help when you are stuck."
   ]
